usage: aethertwin-gateway [-h] [--upstream UPSTREAM] [--host HOST]
                          [--port PORT] [--asset-cache ASSET_CACHE]
                          [--frontend FRONTEND] [--ca-file CA_FILE]
                          [--ssl-certfile SSL_CERTFILE]
                          [--ssl-keyfile SSL_KEYFILE]
                          [--allowed-origin ALLOWED_ORIGIN]

Private, validation-only edge relay. No sensor or inference modules are
loaded. One authenticated upstream WebSocket feeds the existing bounded
SceneHub. HTTP operations run on the relay's private asyncio loop; ASGI uses
worker threads for the synchronous control/export adapters. Credentials never
enter browser state.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --upstream UPSTREAM
  --host HOST
  --port PORT
  --asset-cache ASSET_CACHE
  --frontend FRONTEND
  --ca-file CA_FILE
  --ssl-certfile SSL_CERTFILE
  --ssl-keyfile SSL_KEYFILE
  --allowed-origin ALLOWED_ORIGIN
